  "title": "Champions Reel: How Iga Swiatek won Doha 2024",
  "description": "The 2024 Qatar TotalEnergies Open saw No.1 seed Iga Swiatek became the first player to win a Hologic WTA Tour tournament three years running since Serena Williams at Miami 2013-15. It was Swiatek's 18th career title, 12th at WTA 1000 level or above and 11th on outdoor hard courts.",
